    "detailed_description": "<h1>Update Notes</h1><p>***  Ver 1.10 feature ***\r\nMultiplayer (PvP)</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Click Commander is a Real-Time Strategy game.\r\n\r\nAll you have to do is click to deploy units,but higher strategy is needed to victory.\r\n\r\nVarious units move differently with AI.\r\n\r\nComplete many stages and master strategy.\r\n\r\n(You can play \u03b2 (PvP) mode.Map editor will be added)\r\n\r\n*** Basic strategy ***\r\n\r\n1. Click factory and deploy Infantry unit.\r\n\r\n2. Infantry attack neutral mine and captured mine,and you can earn more money.\r\n\r\n3. Try another unit to destroy all enemy unit",
